  2. Enforce approved and binding architecture decisions

  Approval, applicability, and enforcement must be separate tests.

  Approval gate

  Every active record must have:

  • Status: Accepted;
  • Ratified-by: <role>;
  • Ratified-at: <date/time>;
  • a proposal/version identifier or content hash;
  • an acceptance receipt that identifies exactly what was approved.

